{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.poster.avif?t=1757260064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.webm?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.mp4?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.poster.avif?t=1757260064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.webm?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.mp4?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3126200?t=1757260064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757260064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/f3882d2bc0a9fc155a3d44a4511fbcbe8b089a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757260064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/f3882d2bc0a9fc155a3d44a4511fbcbe8b089a49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757260064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3394350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.poster.avif?t=1757260064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.webm?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/7470fee360f33c39d2b9517b4d88656c.mp4?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.poster.avif?t=1757260064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.webm?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.mp4?t=1757260064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p>","developers":["Estel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/f38f3e4ef38365d64c95f4244740d5a2703497ff/header.jpg?t=1757260064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193802,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193802/movie480.mp4?t=1757169206","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193802/movie_max.mp4?t=1757169206"},"name":"Divine Wish New Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193802/378d054bca822ab2cda05198625ffcd949c955f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757169206","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193802/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757169206","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193802/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757169206"}}],"name":"Divine Wish","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><str